# turn_clock_rpg_edit_hq.phases.pdl - rpg-edit-hq: with In: ON a successful step is a TURN: the clock advances by the TURN row and fires the due clock events (scratch house, no resident clock daemon = the clock_fire_due path). Runner: ops/+x/playthrough_op.+x run play/phases/turn_clock_rpg_edit_hq.phases.pdl
GAME | rpg-edit-hq | rpg_edit_hq
NEEDS | &.widgits/world-ops/ops/+x/wo.+x
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_core.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_toolbar.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_sky.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_footer.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_nudge.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/kh_state_notify.h
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/csv_frames.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_skin_lib.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_autotile.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_life.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_placer.c
CFLAGS | -I$T/@.apps/rpg-edit-hq/ops
INIT | rpg-edit-hq-pchq/pieces/system/maps/.keep | scratch board folder\n
INIT | state/flag_int.txt | 1\n
INIT | time.pdl | SECTION \p KEY \p VALUE\n----------------------------------------\nAT \p day_tick \p +10m \p every:10min \p probe: a DAY row every 10 game minutes\nTURN \p advance \p 5m\n

PHASE | p1_turn_fires_events | In: ON: each act (buying a lamp) is a TURN = 5 minutes; the 10-minute event fires on the second turn only | turn, clock
DO | clock | advance | 1m
MARK | c0 | state/clock_root/#.desktop/clocks/rpg.pdl | game_time_epoch_ms
DO | buy | lamp
SAY | Lamp pillar | first-act-bought-a-lamp
MARK | c1 | state/clock_root/#.desktop/clocks/rpg.pdl | game_time_epoch_ms
DELTA | c0 | c1 | 300000 | turn-one-advanced-the-clock-5-minutes
LACKS | state/events.txt | DAY\p | not-due-yet-after-5-minutes-the-event-has-not-fired
DO | buy | lamp
SAY | Lamp pillar | second-act-bought-another-lamp
MARK | c2 | state/clock_root/#.desktop/clocks/rpg.pdl | game_time_epoch_ms
DELTA | c1 | c2 | 300000 | turn-two-advanced-it-another-5-minutes
HAS | state/events.txt | DAY\p | the-turn-driven-clock-fired-the-10-minute-event
COUNT | state/events.txt | DAY\p | 1 | exactly-one-firing-not-two

PHASE | p2_demo_mode_acts_are_not_turns | In: OFF (demo mode): an act does NOT advance the clock (control: the detector above can see "no change") | turn, demo
DO | int
SAY | INT off | int-toggled-off-for-demo-mode
MARK | d0 | state/clock_root/#.desktop/clocks/rpg.pdl | game_time_epoch_ms
DO | buy | lamp
SAY | Lamp pillar | a-third-lamp-is-bought
MARK | d1 | state/clock_root/#.desktop/clocks/rpg.pdl | game_time_epoch_ms
DELTA | d0 | d1 | 0 | NEGATIVE-with-In-OFF-the-act-did-not-move-the-clock
